WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:16.610
beware of False Prophets

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:19.939
Who come to you in Sheep's Clothing

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:23.899
For inwardly they are Ravening Wolves

00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:30.079
Jesus is the Shepherd who protects you from those wolves

00:00:31.619 --> 00:00:33.619
and I, am his dog

00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:37.700
the sheepdog that get the lambs back on track when they stray off the path

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:42.469
And some of you have strayed, haven't you?

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:48.280
Mama? Are you evil?

00:00:49.109 --> 00:00:52.399
Reverend says he's here to take you back where he came from

00:00:54.269 --> 00:01:00.919
I know you're there. And I know you can hear me. You may have no tongue but there is nothing wrong with your ears

00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:05.100
Do you know, why I'm here?

00:01:13.020 --> 00:01:16.120
I'm here to punish you

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:18.120
Why do you let him do this?

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:20.120
It's a sin

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:24.860
I love him!

00:01:24.860 --> 00:01:26.860
You do not. It is lust.

00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:31.120
He ain't never gonna stop, is he?

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:37.450
I've seen your mother she's the kind of person that turns the other cheek, be like her.

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:51.490
Never leave your loved ones alone, you should know that by now

